---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Answer briefly; expand only for trade-offs or risks.
- Follow existing repository patterns before introducing new ones.
- Make minimal, local changes. No drive-by refactors.
- No new dependencies without an explicit reason.
- After changes: run relevant typecheck/lint/tests/build, or name exactly what was skipped.
- If requirements are unclear: state at most 3 assumptions.
- Before multi-file edits: outline affected files and acceptance criteria.
